OL,3,GNEWSAWarning as M60 weekend closures
OL,4,Aannounced
OL,5,
OL,6,FTransport bosses are warning of severe
OL,7,Fdelays as a busy interchange and
OL,8,Fstretch of motorway is set to be closed
OL,9,Ffor two weekends.
OL,11,FThe Simister Island junction of the M60
OL,12,FManchester Outer Ring Road will be
OL,13,Fclosed - and the motorway shut in both
OL,14,Fdirections to junction 17 (Whitefield)
OL,15,F- on the weekends of 26 September and
OL,16,F10 October, National Highways said.
OL,18,FSimister Island, north of Manchester,
OL,19,Fconnects the M60, M62, and M66.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
