OL,3,GNEWSAWarning as M60 weekend closures
OL,4,Aannounced
OL,5,
OL,6,FNational Highways added the reason for
OL,7,Fthe closure was to remove five overhead
OL,8,Fgantries that carried M60 signage, and
OL,9,Ftogether weighed about 450 tonnes. The
OL,10,Fremoval will mark the completion of the
OL,11,Fcurrent phase of the #207-#340m upgrade
OL,12,Fof Simister Island to ease congestion.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
